Monsters can (and do) spawn anywhere on the level, pretty much.  They are
highly unlikely to spawn *anywhere* in your field of view, but it *can*
happen; monsters spawn in the Bigroom, after all.

However, monsters are affected by certain traps; this may have led to the
soldier ant appearing next to you from some considerable distance away.

Wizards need to make full use of their pets, and should try not to gain
too many levels until they've managed to get some protection and/or some
nice cloth and leather armour.

